Daimon::isValidSignature (ERC-1271 / ERC-7739)
├── given a ROOT-mode signature over the nested PersonalSign digest
│   ├── when signed by an installed ROOT signer
│   │   └── it should return the 0x1626ba7e magic value
│   └── when signed by a non-owner
│       └── it should return 0xffffffff (failure)
└── given a MANDATE-mode (0x01) signature
    └── it should return 0xffffffff — MANDATE 1271 not yet supported
